Assets fetched at runtime
-------------------------
The demos load Factory/factory_gear_medium.usd from the Isaac Sim asset
server through ISAACLAB_NUCLEUS_DIR. The Robotiq example resolves
Isaac/Robots/Robotiq/2F-85/Robotiq_2F_85_edit.usd from the configured
Isaac Sim asset library. The gripper model is attributed to Robotiq and
provided through NVIDIA's Isaac Sim asset library.

These third-party models and their dependent meshes, materials, and textures
are obtained separately and are not redistributed in this repository. They
retain their applicable NVIDIA and third-party terms; the repository's
Apache-2.0 license does not apply to those external assets.

